      <h1>Zanzibar Spice Farm Cultural Experience</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">Discover the aromatic heritage of Zanzibar's spice farms, a sensory journey through cloves, vanilla, cinnamon, and nutmeg that have shaped the island's history and culture.</p>
    </div>
