          <h3>Sensory Walk</h3>
          <p>Guided tours walk you through spice plantations, encouraging you to touch, smell, and taste fresh spices directly from the source. An immersive experience for all ages.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-item reveal delay-2">
          <h3>Local Knowledge</h3>
          <p>Knowledgeable local guides share centuries-old traditions, folk tales, and medicinal uses of each spice. Learn how spices are integrated into daily Zanzibari life.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-item reveal delay-3">
          <h3>Fresh Products</h3>
          <p>Many farms offer fresh spice products for purchase — ground spices, essential oils, and whole beans that make perfect souvenirs and ensure authenticity.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-item reveal delay-4">
          <h3>Cultural Connection</h3>
          <p>Understand how the spice trade shaped Stone Town's architecture, cuisine, and multicultural population. The spice farms are living museums of Zanzibar's global connections.</p>
        </div>
